{
    "version": "0.1.7",
    "description": "恒烈CTF编码工具箱 - 本地优先、零外发的编解码/加解密/隐写分析工具箱（753个操作、18类能力）",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Henglie/EBCTFCodeBox",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "url": "https://github.com/Henglie/EBCTFCodeBox/releases/download/v0.1.7/EBCTFCodeBox-v0.1.7.zip#/EBCTFCodeBox.zip",
    "hash": "sha256:df15cde46aeb9c9e998d1e895beed1660987a9ccbaba01b1eeeb2359ab7eda44",
    "suggest": {
        "python": "uv"
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $dir -Filter *.py | Where-Object { $_.Name -ne 'bridge.py' } | Rename-Item -NewName 'start.py'",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\EBCTFCodeBox.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0', '@uv run python start.py %*', '@popd' -Encoding Ascii"
    ],
    "post_install": [
        "uv venv \"$dir\\.venv\""
    ],
    "bin": "EBCTFCodeBox.bat",
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Henglie/EBCTFCodeBox/releases/download/v$version/EBCTFCodeBox-v$version.zip#/EBCTFCodeBox.zip"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【工具类型】: 安全测试（CTF 综合工具箱）",
        "【主要功能】: 汇聚编解码、古典密码、现代加密、哈希校验、进制转换、密码爆破与隐写分析等 753 个操作，核心计算浏览器本地完成、零外发",
        "【适用场景】: CTF 竞赛解题、密码学学习、日常编解码转换与拖入文件取证分析",
        "【技术特点】: 纯静态 ES module + WASM，无构建步骤；Python 标准库启动本地静态服务（默认 8180）与 Windows 本地桥（8181），支持 PWA 离线",
        "【注意事项】: 通过 uv 提供 Python 3，首次运行 uv 可能自动下载解释器；启动后自动打开浏览器；追加 --no-bridge 可跳过本地桥；8180-8199 端口被占用时自动顺延"
    ]
}
